    test(orchestrator): pin the beforeSession failure path

    A throw from beforeSession escapes before the catch/finally exist, so
    neither onError nor afterSession runs (re-cinq/HALEngine#94). Pin the
    guarantee as an acceptance test and record it in the spec, replacing
    the recorded-flaw bullet it supersedes.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>

